Z||000010||Pontiaddict||02-15-2001||05:35 PM||||Great in theory, but make different classes.<BR>Or at least group them in heats according to practice times. <BR>If they sandbag then bump them up a class. You can regulate them to a duke block and heads and let them take their chances with the upgrades. <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000011||Will||02-15-2001||08:25 PM||||Why limit it to Fieros? Let the other Dukes play: Cavaliers, base Sunfires, Sunbirds (did they have the duke?), and any other car that had a Duke from the factory.<BR>I imagine that of that lot, the Fiero would probably dominate, though.||||reg||1
